---
import PublicLayout from '../layouts/PublicLayout.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../components/SectionHeader.astro';
---

<PublicLayout
  title="About — AI Idea Researcher"
  description="Learn about AI Idea Researcher — why it exists, what we believe, and who's behind it."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="container-page pt-20 pb-16 md:pt-28 md:pb-24 ">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <span class="mb-4 inline-block rounded-full border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-body">
        About us
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl">
        We believe great products start with great research
      </h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg text-body">
        AI Idea Researcher exists to close the gap between having an idea and knowing it's worth building.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission -->
  <section class="container-page pb-20 md:pb-28 ">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <SectionHeader
        title="Our mission"
        description="Make market research accessible to every builder — not just teams with analysts and big budgets."
      />
      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-md border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated p-6">
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">The problem we saw</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body">
            Every day, thousands of developers, founders, and product people spend hours reading articles, browsing GitHub, and scanning trend reports — hoping to spot an opportunity. Most of them miss it. Not because they're not smart, but because the signal-to-noise ratio is terrible and the tools don't exist to help.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-md border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated p-6">
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">What we're doing about it</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body">
            We're building the research layer that every product team deserves. AI agents that work for you — scanning the web, identifying patterns, scoring opportunities, and delivering structured reports to your inbox every morning. Less time searching, more time building.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Story -->
  <section class="container-page pb-20 md:pb-28 ">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <SectionHeader
        title="Why it exists"
      />
      <div class="mt-12 space-y-6 text-body">
        <p>
          AI Idea Researcher started with a frustration shared by many builders: we had the skills to build products, but not the structured process to find the right ones. We'd launch something, realize the market was too small, and start over.
        </p>
        <p>
          We tried spreadsheets. We tried hiring analysts. We tried reading everything on the internet every morning. None of it scaled.
        </p>
        <p>
          Then we realized: the research itself doesn't need to be harder. The problem is gathering, organizing, and scoring hundreds of data points from dozens of sources. That's exactly what AI is good at.
        </p>
        <p>
          So we built AI Idea Researcher — a tool that does the grunt work of market research automatically, so builders can focus on what they do best: creating products people actually want.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Principles -->
  <section class="container-page pb-20 md:pb-28 ">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <SectionHeader
        title="What we believe"
      />
      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="flex h-10 w-10 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-hairline-soft text-ink">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Speed matters</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-body">The sooner you spot a trend, the more advantage you have. Real-time research isn't a luxury — it's a competitive necessity.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="flex h-10 w-10 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-hairline-soft text-ink">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Transparency wins</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-body">Every score, every recommendation comes with the evidence behind it. No black boxes. You decide what to trust.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="flex h-10 w-10 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-hairline-soft text-ink">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 6V4m0 2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m-6 8a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4m6 6v10m6-2a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4" /></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Keep it simple</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-body">Research shouldn't require a PhD. If a feature needs a tutorial, it's too complex. Simple tools get used every day.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="flex h-10 w-10 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-hairline-soft text-ink">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Builders first</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-body">We build for people who ship. Every feature is evaluated against one question: does this help someone build a product faster?</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Team -->
  <section class="container-page pb-20 md:pb-28 ">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <SectionHeader
        title="The team"
        description="A small team obsessed with making research useful."
      />
      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-md border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated p-6 text-center">
          <div class="mx-auto mb-3 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-hairline-soft text-xl font-semibold text-ink">
            A
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Alex Morgan</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-mute">Co-founder & CEO</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-body">Previously built developer tools at [Company]. Obsessed with finding signal in noise.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-md border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated p-6 text-center">
          <div class="mx-auto mb-3 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-hairline-soft text-xl font-semibold text-ink">
            J
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Jordan Lee</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-mute">Co-founder & CTO</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-body">Full-stack engineer with a background in NLP and data pipelines. Built the research engine from scratch.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-md border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated p-6 text-center">
          <div class="mx-auto mb-3 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-hairline-soft text-xl font-semibold text-ink">
            S
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Sam Rivera</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-mute">Head of Product</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-body">Former PM at [Company]. Brings the user's perspective to every feature decision.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6 text-center text-xs text-mute">
        * Team details are placeholders and will be updated.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="container-page pb-20 md:pb-28 ">
    <div class="rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated px-8 py-16 text-center shadow-whisper">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl">
        Want to work with us?
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-lg text-lg text-body">
        We're always looking for people who care about making research accessible. Reach out — we'd love to hear from you.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
        <a href="/contact" class="rounded-sm bg-primary px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-on-primary no-underline transition-opacity hover:opacity-90">
          Get in touch
        </a>
        <a href="/features" class="rounded-sm border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-ink no-underline transition-colors hover:bg-hairline-soft">
          See what we're building
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</PublicLayout>
